      "label": "legend_0050_friend_14",
      "hash64": "F0558F89AF8223AF",
      "text": "它的身体看起来很健康，\\n会不会是因为什么精神上的原因，\\r\\n才无法恢复原本的样子？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "legend_0050_select_03",
      "hash64": "CD0CFF4801CC6967",
      "text": "精神上的原因？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "legend_0050_select_04",
      "hash64": "CD0CFC4801CC644E",
      "text": "什么意思？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_15",
      "hash64": "F0558E89AF8221FC",
      "text": "内心受的伤……是叫精神创伤来着？\\n我在哪本书上读到过。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_19",
      "hash64": "F0559289AF8228C8",
      "text": "或许它在对战中有过恐怖的经历，\\n所以才变得害怕对战了吧……？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_16",
      "hash64": "F0559189AF822715",
      "text": "……没关系！这家伙和獒教父，\\n总有一天都会完全恢复的！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_17",
      "hash64": "F0559089AF822562",
      "text": "獒教父，\\n调味料的效果感觉怎么样……！？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "legend_0050_mastiff_03",
      "hash64": "451820484C662F95",
      "text": "……獒呼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_18",
      "hash64": "F0559389AF822A7B",
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_28",
      "hash64": "F04B9189AF79D290",
      "text": "并不一定每次都能\\n很好地恢复活力吧。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_29",
      "hash64": "F04B9289AF79D443",
      "text": "也并不是\\n马上就能显出效果。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
