      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_26",
      "hash64": "F04B9F89AF79EA5A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n寻找调味料的旅程，\\r\\n下一次就是终点了！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
